{"id":"Evelynn","key":"28","name":{"en":"Evelynn","zh_TW":"伊芙琳","zh_CN":"伊芙琳"},"title":{"en":"Agony's Embrace","zh_TW":"臨終擁抱","zh_CN":"痛苦之拥"},"tags":["Assassin","Mage"],"icon":"img/champion/Evelynn.png","passive":{"name":{"en":"Demon Shade","zh_TW":"魔魅之影","zh_CN":"恶魔魅影"},"description":{"en":"When out of combat, Evelynn enters Demon Shade. Demon Shade heals Evelynn when she is low on health and grants Camouflage after level 6.","zh_TW":"脫離戰鬥後，伊芙琳會被魔魅之影籠罩。若伊芙琳的生命低於一定值，魔魅之影將會使她迅速回復生命。等級 6 之後，魔魅之影還會賦予伊芙琳偽裝能力。","zh_CN":"在非战斗状态下，伊芙琳进入【恶魔魅影】。【恶魔魅影】会在伊芙琳生命值较低时治疗她，并在6级后为她提供【伪装】。"},"icon":"img/passive/Evelynn_Passive.png"},"spells":[{"slot":"Q","name":{"en":"Hate Spike","zh_TW":"憎恨尖刺","zh_CN":"憎恨之刺"},"description":{"en":"Evelynn strikes out with her Lasher, dealing damage to the first unit hit. Then, Evelynn can shoot a line of spikes at nearby foes a few times.","zh_TW":"伊芙琳甩出身上的背刺，對首位命中的單位造成傷害。接著，她可重施技能數次，施放一連串的尖刺傷害周圍的敵人。","zh_CN":"伊芙琳用鞭子进行抽击，对命中的第一个敌方单位造成伤害。随后，伊芙琳可以朝附近的敌人发出一列尖刺，可发射若干次。"},"cooldown":"4","cost":"40/45/50/55/60","range":"800","icon":"img/spell/EvelynnQ.png"},{"slot":"W","name":{"en":"Allure","zh_TW":"咒慾迷塵","zh_CN":"引诱"},"description":{"en":"Evelynn curses her target, causing her next attack or spell after a delay to charm her target and reduce their magic resist.","zh_TW":"伊芙琳詛咒一名目標，短暫延遲之後她的普攻或技能將使目標受到魅惑，同時降低其魔法防禦。","zh_CN":"伊芙琳诅咒她的目标，并使她在一段延时后的下次攻击或技能对目标施加魅惑和魔抗击碎效果。"},"cooldown":"15/14/13/12/11","cost":"60/70/80/90/100","range":"1200/1300/1400/1500/1600","icon":"img/spell/EvelynnW.png"},{"slot":"E","name":{"en":"Whiplash","zh_TW":"奪魂鞭索","zh_CN":"鞭笞"},"description":{"en":"Evelynn whips her target with her Lasher, dealing damage. She then gains Move Speed for a short duration.","zh_TW":"伊芙琳使用背刺穿刺目標並造成傷害。接著她將獲得額外跑速，持續一小段時間。","zh_CN":"伊芙琳鞭笞她的目标，并造成伤害。她随后会获得短暂持续的移动速度加成。"},"cooldown":"8","cost":"40/45/50/55/60","range":"210","icon":"img/spell/EvelynnE.png"},{"slot":"R","name":{"en":"Last Caress","zh_TW":"殘戮收割","zh_CN":"最终抚慰"},"description":{"en":"Evelynn briefly goes untargetable and decimates the area in front of her before warping backwards a long distance.","zh_TW":"伊芙琳短暫進入無法被指定的狀態，在瞬移至原先位置後方之前用背刺橫掃前方所有敵人。","zh_CN":"伊芙琳短暂进入不可被选取状态并大肆残杀她面前区域内的敌人，然后向后位移一大段距离。"},"cooldown":"120/100/80","cost":"100","range":"25000","icon":"img/spell/EvelynnR.png"}],"skins":[{"id":"28001","num":1,"name":{"en":"Shadow Evelynn","zh_TW":"影之女王 伊芙琳","zh_CN":"黑暗女王 伊芙琳"}},{"id":"28002","num":2,"name":{"en":"Masquerade Evelynn","zh_TW":"假面女皇 伊芙琳","zh_CN":"假面女皇 伊芙琳"}},{"id":"28003","num":3,"name":{"en":"Tango Evelynn","zh_TW":"探戈靈魂 伊芙琳","zh_CN":"探戈灵魂 伊芙琳"}},{"id":"28004","num":4,"name":{"en":"Safecracker Evelynn","zh_TW":"妙手空空 伊芙琳","zh_CN":"惊天魔盗 伊芙琳"}},{"id":"28005","num":5,"name":{"en":"Blood Moon Evelynn","zh_TW":"血月魅影 伊芙琳","zh_CN":"腥红之月 伊芙琳"}},{"id":"28006","num":6,"name":{"en":"K/DA Evelynn","zh_TW":"K/DA 伊芙琳","zh_CN":"K/DA 伊芙琳"}},{"id":"28007","num":7,"name":{"en":"Prestige K/DA Evelynn","zh_TW":"尊爵不凡 K/DA 伊芙琳","zh_CN":"至臻 K/DA 伊芙琳"}},{"id":"28008","num":8,"name":{"en":"Sugar Rush Evelynn","zh_TW":"草莓黑森琳","zh_CN":"糖果大战 伊芙琳"}},{"id":"28015","num":15,"name":{"en":"K/DA ALL OUT Evelynn","zh_TW":"K/DA ALL OUT 伊芙琳","zh_CN":"K/DA ALL OUT 伊芙琳"}},{"id":"28024","num":24,"name":{"en":"Coven Evelynn","zh_TW":"女巫集會 伊芙琳","zh_CN":"魔女 伊芙琳"}},{"id":"28031","num":31,"name":{"en":"Prestige K/DA Evelynn (2022)","zh_TW":"尊爵不凡 K/DA 伊芙琳(2022)","zh_CN":"至臻 K/DA 伊芙琳 (2022)"}},{"id":"28032","num":32,"name":{"en":"Spirit Blossom Evelynn","zh_TW":"靈花祭 伊芙琳","zh_CN":"灵魂莲华 伊芙琳"}},{"id":"28042","num":42,"name":{"en":"Soul Fighter Evelynn","zh_TW":"戰魂鬥士 伊芙琳","zh_CN":"斗魂觉醒 伊芙琳"}},{"id":"28052","num":52,"name":{"en":"High Noon Evelynn","zh_TW":"西域牛仔 伊芙琳","zh_CN":"西部魔影 伊芙琳"}},{"id":"28053","num":53,"name":{"en":"Prestige High Noon Evelynn","zh_TW":"尊爵不凡 西域牛仔 伊芙琳","zh_CN":"至臻 西部魔影 伊芙琳"}},{"id":"28064","num":64,"name":{"en":"Nightbringer Evelynn","zh_TW":"闇夜使者 伊芙琳","zh_CN":"黑夜使者 伊芙琳"}}],"quotes":[{"id":"Evelynn/base/pick-1","champion":"Evelynn","voiceSet":"base","event":"pick","text"